                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/snorkeling/penida-snorkeling-gopro.webp" alt="Fotografi bawah air snorkeling Nusa Penida" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                        <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/snorkeling/surrounded-with-fish-penida.webp" alt="Penyelam dikelilingi ikan tropis di Nusa Penida" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
